 "hd": {
  "scene": "shocktr2",
  "note": "the HD scene is laid out like Metal Slug: the soldier chosen, the lives in reserve, the energy, the weapon and its power as on the game's screen (Lv and three P, a P item adds 4 to the power, three of them are a level, 36 is Lv3 with its three P), the grenades, and the second player. A big machine gets its life bar once it has been hit three times: an object that came with an energy of big_min (150) or more. The boss is announced when the game does (\"_boss\", ALERT on its screen) with the mission's name for it, then each of its parts being shot at gets a bar, and BOSS DESTROYED comes when the game stops its timer again (\"_wait\"). part_min (100) is the least energy a part of a boss comes with"
 },
